contentText:
If you&#8217;ve ever played Street Fighter , there&#8217;s a good chance you might recognize &#8220;Guile&#8217;s Theme&#8221; before the first few notes even finish. Now, the famous melody has been transformed into a cinematic piece that gives the tune a new, adrenaline-filled life.

Leo Birenberg and Zach Robinson have unveiled their new version of &#8220;Guile&#8217;s Theme,&#8221; the lead single from the upcoming Street Fighter original motion picture soundtrack &#8212; and Billboard is exclusively revealing the full track list for the soundtrack below as well. &#8220;Guile&#8217;s Theme&#8221; arrives ahead of the film&#8217;s Oct. 16 theatrical release, giving one of the video game franchise&#8217;s signature musical pieces a cinematic upgrade. It pairs its familiar melody with orchestral arrangements, electric guitar and an overall heroic sound.

